>> Combination := Liis cusub.

Combination marka: ['dhammaadka-ku-dar:'] samee: { :el
	naf 
	hel: el, Waxba? run: { naf dhammaadka-ku-dar: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination cusub.
colours
	dhammaadka-ku-dar: ['red'],
	dhammaadka-ku-dar: ['green'],
	dhammaadka-ku-dar: ['blue'],
	dhammaadka-ku-dar: ['red'].

Soo-saar qor: colours, sadar-cusub.
